{"title":"심장을 바쳐라!","artist":"Linked Horizon","sourceId":"reference:zH8XA3lnpLhrFMeqedDv","sourceHash":"d26e49660c1eb150224a118f38f13db2a3d9314b6b364e5e3df9a091735151e5","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":35776413,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":8.32,"end":14.11,"text":"これ以上の地獄はないだろうと信じたかった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":14.11,"end":19.99,"text":"されど人類最悪の日はいつも唐突に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":19.99,"end":26.01,"text":"扉を叩く音は絶えず酷く無作法で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":26.01,"end":32.13,"text":"招かれざる災厄の灯は悪夢のように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":32.13,"end":38.17,"text":"過ぎし日を裏切る者 奴らは駆逐すべき敵だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":38.17,"end":44.25,"text":"あの日どんな顔で瞳で俺達を見つめていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":44.25,"end":47.32,"text":"何を捨てれば悪魔をも凌げる？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":47.32,"end":53.12,"text":"命さえ 魂さえ 決して惜しくなどはない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":53.12,"end":58.98,"text":"捧げよ！ 捧げよ！ 心臓を捧げよ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":58.98,"end":65.09,"text":"全ての犠牲は今、この瞬間のために","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":65.09,"end":71.0,"text":"捧げよ！ 捧げよ！ 心臓を捧げよ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":71.0,"end":77.03999999999999,"text":"進むべき未来を その手で切り拓け！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":90.63,"end":96.66,"text":"過ぎし日追い詰める者 奴らは憎悪をすべき敵だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":96.66,"end":102.86,"text":"あの日どんな声で言葉で俺たちを騙っていた？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":102.86,"end":105.89,"text":"何を学べば悪魔をも屠れる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":105.89,"end":108.32,"text":"技術でも戦術でも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":108.32,"end":111.58,"text":"全て無駄になどにしない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":111.58,"end":117.47999999999999,"text":"捧げよ！ 捧げよ！ 心臓を捧げよ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":117.47999999999999,"end":123.46,"text":"全ての努力は今、この瞬間のために","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":123.46,"end":129.44,"text":"捧げよ！ 捧げよ！ 心臓を捧げよ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":129.44,"end":135.68,"text":"謳うべき勝利を その手で掴み取れ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":149.13,"end":155.14,"text":"得体の知れない化物が人と似た面をしてやがる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":155.14,"end":161.17000000000002,"text":"この世から一匹残らず奴らを駆逐してやる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":161.17000000000002,"end":167.25,"text":"最初に言い出したのは誰か？ そんなこと覚えちゃいないが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":167.25,"end":172.89,"text":"忘れられない怒りがある 必ず駆逐してやる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":172.89,"end":178.98,"text":"嗚呼... 選び悔いた道の先はどんな景色に繋がっている？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":178.98,"end":185.13,"text":"ただ捧げられた人生を糧に咲く 尊き彼岸の勝利","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":185.13,"end":189.02,"text":"約束の地は楽園の果て","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":263.06,"end":265.9,"text":"あの日人類は思い出した","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":265.9,"end":269.67,"text":"奴らに支配されていた恐怖を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":269.67,"end":275.18,"text":"鳥籠の中に囚われていた屈辱を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":275.18,"end":281.11,"text":"黄昏を 弓矢は翔ける 翼を背負い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":281.11,"end":288.67,"text":"その奇跡が自由への道と成る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":288.67,"end":295.0,"text":"捧げよ！ 捧げよ！ 心臓を捧げよ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":295.0,"end":301.26,"text":"全ての苦難は今、この瞬間のために","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":301.26,"end":307.34,"text":"捧げよ！ 捧げよ！ 心臓を捧げよ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":307.34,"end":313.15,"text":"儚き命を燃える弓矢に変えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":313.15,"end":319.27,"text":"捧げよ！ 捧げよ！ 心臓を捧げよ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":319.27,"end":327.08,"text":"起こるべき奇跡をその身で描き出せ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}